stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> queued
  queued --> claimed: Due and lease available
  retry_due --> claimed: Backoff ends
  claimed --> claimed: Lease expires and new token replaces old token
  claimed --> claimed: Attempt reservation renews the send lease
  claimed --> accepted_by_provider: Provider accepts and token still matches
  claimed --> retry_due: Transient failure within attempt and expiry budget
  claimed --> retry_due: Quiet hours or capacity or breaker or daily budget defers without send
  claimed --> suppressed: Opt out or resolved card or revoked installation
  claimed --> expired: Event reaches 24 hours
  claimed --> failed: Permanent failure or third attempt
  state Provider {
    [*] --> closed
    closed --> open: Five consecutive transient failures
    open --> half_open: Five minutes pass and one probe leases
    half_open --> closed: Probe accepted
    half_open --> open: Probe fails or crashes
  }
  %% never Send a quiet, resolved, opted-out or expired card.
  %% never Allow a stale claim token to acknowledge another attempt.
  %% never Treat provider acceptance as a human read.
  %% never Allow more than one half-open probe.
